213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (Lending institutions must decide, for every application, whether to grant a loan. A wrong approval can turn into a default and a credit loss, while a wrong rejection means a creditworthy customer is lost to a competitor. Traditional manual review is slow and can be inconsistent between officers. A predictive model trained on historical decisions can help screen applications quickly and consistently, so that human reviewers can focus on borderline cases. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
