216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (The central problem addressed in this project is to classify loan applications into two outcome groups: approved and not approved. The model must learn from historical labelled examples and predict the outcome for an application whose decision is not yet known. The results should be reported with metrics that a business user can interpret, in particular precision and recall, rather than accuracy alone. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
