/T (Everymodel is evaluated on the same 200-record test set using accuracy, precision, recall and F1-score, withapproved loans treated as the positive class. Table 4 summarisesthe results. )
/E (Everymodel is evaluated on the same 200-record test set using accuracy, precision, recall and F1-score, withapproved loans treated as the positive class. Table 4 summarisesthe results. )
