/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (This project developed a loan approval prediction workflow using a 1,000-record dataset, systematic data preparation and eight machine-learning classifiers. The tuned XGBoost classifier performed best, with 93.5% accuracy, 85.3% precision, 95.1% recall and 89.9% F1-score on the test set, and a best cross-validated accuracy of 95.0%. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
