442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Future extensions may include: \(1\) stratified splits and repeated cross-validation; \(2\) tuning on recall, F1 or a business-cost metric; \(3\) experiments with SMOTE and class weighting; \(4\) comparison of imputation methods, with imputation fitted inside a pipeline; \(5\) SHAP-based explanations for individual decisions; \(6\) threshold selection based on the cost of false approvals and false rejections; \(7\) fairness analysis and removal or review of sensitive features; \(8\) saving the model and building a web application for loan officers; and \(9\) validation on a larger, real-world dataset and monitoring after deployment. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
