444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (A practical loan approval system must combine predictive performance with clear interpretation, fairness and an understanding of business costs. The current project provides a working educational prototype and a foundation for these improvements. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
