/Title (The dataset overview is summarised below. The dataset has 1,000 applicants and an approval rate of about 29.8%; aftercleaning and encoding, 27 features are used by the models, and 200 records are held out as the test set.Not-approved applications form the larger class, which is why precision and recall are reported alongsideaccuracy.)
