<<
/Title (Loan approval is one of the most consequential decisions in retail banking. Approving a borrower who later defaults creates credit losses, while rejecting a creditworthy applicant means lost business. This project, CreditWise, presents a machine-learning approach for predicting whether a loan application will be approved, using a dataset of 1,000 applicant records with 20 original columns and an approval rate of approximately 29.8%.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 822 0 R
/Next 850 0 R
>>
endobj
