850 0 obj
<<
/Title (The workflow includes missing-value handling, removal of the applicant identifier, categorical encoding, exploratory analysis, and binary classification. Numerical columns are filled with the mean and categorical columns with the most frequent value; Education_Level and the target are label encoded and six further categorical columns are one-hot encoded, giving 27 input features. An 80/20 train-test split is used, and standard scaling is applied for the linear, distance-based and probabilistic models. Eight classifiers are compared: Logistic Regression, KNN, Naive Bayes, Random Forest, Gradient Boosting, XGBoost, AdaBoost and a Stacking Classifier, with the tree-ensemble models tuned using GridSearchCV with 5-fold cross-validation.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 822 0 R
/Prev 835 0 R
/Next 836 0 R
>>
