/Title (Preprocessing runs in sequence: imputation, identifier removal, encoding, train-test split and scaling. StandardScaler is fitted on the training set only and then applied to the test set. Scaled features are used for Logistic Regression, KNN and Naive Bayes, which are sensitive to feature scale; the tree-based models \(Random Forest, Gradient Boosting, XGBoost, AdaBoost and Stacking\) use unscaled features. In the notebook these steps are separate cells rather than a single scikit-learn Pipeline.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 872 0 R
>>
endobj
